  "description": "DESIGNED FOR LONG ROUTES\n\nIts oversized head tube, slightly sloping top tube, and wide wheelbase are the key to agile and safe riding on any terrain.\n\n*Includes Universal UDH hanger.\n\nFULL CARBON GRAVEL AIR BOW FORK\n\nIts Gravel Air Bow fork, full carbon, with its distinctive and characteristic shape, offers great vibration absorption and oversized clearance for tires up to 45 mm.\n\nAERODYNAMIC OPTIMIZATION\n\nAlthough it is a gravel bike, we didn’t want to leave aerodynamics aside.\n\nInspired by the Aerolight philosophy, de la Aerolight, ofrece un gran comportamiento con una resistencia it offers great performance with minimal air resistance.\n\nDESIGNED FOR BIKEPACKING\n\nThe frame and fork include multiple mounting points compatible with all transport accessories on the market, allowing you to customize the bike for long-distance trips and adventures.\n\nEASY-TO-USE QUICKLEVERS\n\nThe 12 mm Thru Axle closures incorporate the “Quick Lever” system, hidden and tool-free.\n\nHEADSET + HANDLEBAR\n\nThe integrated set maximizes aerodynamics and efficiency in air penetration.\n\nTIRES UP TO 45MM\n\nCompatible with tires up to 45 mm, offering extra safety, grip, and comfort on long and demanding routes.",
